|> I have problems to make a NIS Group map with a group with more than 1014
|> characters. This problem ist the same on a DEC OSF/1 3.0 an a SGI IRIX 5.3

This is an general limitation of NIS. Any NIS record could not be longer
than 1k Byte (maybe there are some byte required for Key and housekeeping,
so the limit is probably somewhat lower).

You could workaround this limit, as a netgroup member could be again a
netgroup. So you could use a two or three level scheme to split up your
data into different records.

