Hi Everybody,

This query is specific to DEC OSF/1 3.x.
It's regarding the "IFNET bridge" and the "packet filter".

Firstly, the document "Network Programmers Guide" mentions that the
IFNET bridge can be used to exchange data between a STREAMS driver and
