Harry,

Your question would probably be better served if posted in the comp.os.vms
group as it is focused on OpenVMS issues.

One approach to print the rather large records in your file is:

$ TYPE/OUTPUT=foo.lis bar.file
$ PRINT foo.lis

 where you replace the lowercase file names with names of your own.  

I am assuming bar.file is the name of your existing file and foo.lis is just a
temporary file used to 'pipe' the data.

You can view the actual file contents using the DUMP command.  Use HELP DUMP
for details.

$ DUMP bar.file

will probably do exactly what you wish.

Have fun,
don

