>version), I have the customised Version but without the Tape-Utilities.
>Or is there a driver available for the DEC TLZ04?

EZ-SCSI V3.1 won't work with the TLZ04.

There is no tape driver in EZ-SCSI.  The application, in this case, BACKUP,
