with it too much....

2) The instrument controller program now runs 5 times too fast!  It's 
supposed to change the settings and take readings once every 15 seconds;
instead it's about once every 3 seconds.  Since timing is critical in
the instrument it's controlling, this causes a few problems.

Anyway, I can see two possible solutions:  

