How are you making the connection on the server end? If you exist in its 
/etc/hosts file (you should) you ought to connect as that ip-address. If 
your connection is a random assignment, then the ppp.conf or ppp.cf or 
whatever it is called ;under Ultrix whould have an entry pppAccccount in 
remotehost=pppinbound)or whatever you call it) and the localhost 0,0 
entry should  be there.  If not, then pppinbound must have a fixed ip 
existing in the hosts file.




